WEBVTT

00:00:03.753 --> 00:00:07.313
Maybe I should've
hooked him up to Bessie...

00:00:08.073 --> 00:00:11.393
...and then...
then took the boot off.

00:00:12.873 --> 00:00:15.233
Whoo-hoo!

00:00:15.993 --> 00:00:19.993
Goodbye, Radiator Springs,
and goodbye, Bessie!

00:00:20.073 --> 00:00:23.913
California, here I come! Yeah!

00:00:26.273 --> 00:00:28.273
Oh, feel that wind.

00:00:28.753 --> 00:00:30.353
Yes!

00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:31.433
[sputtering]

00:00:31.513 --> 00:00:33.553
No. No, no, no.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.153
No, no, no, no, no. Outta gas?

00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:38.233
How can I be outta gas?

00:00:38.273 --> 00:00:42.273
[chuckling] Boy, we ain't
as dumb as you think we are.

00:00:42.313 --> 00:00:44.633
[stuttering] But how did,
how did... you...?

00:00:44.713 --> 00:00:47.073
We siphoned your gas
while you were passed out.

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:50.033
- Ka-chow.
- Ow, ow, ow, ow.

00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:00.833
- Gentlemen.
- Sheriff.

00:01:00.913 --> 00:01:01.993
Hey, Sheriff.

00:01:02.073 --> 00:01:04.313
- Why here?
- [Italian] Sono sempre stati qui.

00:01:04.433 --> 00:01:06.913
- They were better before.
- Stai sempre a parlare.

00:01:06.953 --> 00:01:08.833
- Guido!
- Red, can you move over?

00:01:08.913 --> 00:01:11.753
I want to get a look
at that sexy hot rod.

00:01:11.793 --> 00:01:14.633
You know, I used to be
a purty good whistler.

00:01:14.713 --> 00:01:17.473
I can't do it now, of course,
on account of sometimes

00:01:17.513 --> 00:01:20.433
I get fluid built up
in my engine block,

00:01:20.473 --> 00:01:23.833
but Doc said he's gonna fix it.
He can fix about anything.

00:01:23.953 --> 00:01:26.153
That's why we made him the judge.

00:01:26.313 --> 00:01:30.473
Boy, you shoulda heard me on
Giddy-up, Oom Papa Mow Mow.

00:01:30.553 --> 00:01:31.953
Now, I'm not one to brag

00:01:31.993 --> 00:01:35.313
but people come purty far
to see me get low on the "Mow-Mow".

00:01:35.793 --> 00:01:36.833
Oh!

00:01:36.873 --> 00:01:39.713
- Aw, man, that's just great!
- Hey, what's wrong?

00:01:39.793 --> 00:01:41.593
My lucky sticker's all dirty.

00:01:41.673 --> 00:01:43.913
Ah, that ain't nothin'.
I'll clean it for ya.

00:01:43.993 --> 00:01:48.673
- [snorting, hacking]
- No, no, no!

00:01:48.753 --> 00:01:51.073
That won't be necessary.

00:01:52.153 --> 00:01:55.473
Hey! Hey, big fella!
Yeah, you in the red!

00:01:55.513 --> 00:01:58.193
I could use a little hose down.
Help me wash this off.

00:02:00.593 --> 00:02:01.593
Where's he goin'?

00:02:01.673 --> 00:02:05.113
Oh, he's a little bit shy, and
he hates you for killin' his flowers.

00:02:05.193 --> 00:02:06.673
I shouldn't put up with this.

00:02:06.753 --> 00:02:09.633
I'm a precision instrument
of speed and aerodynamics.

00:02:09.673 --> 00:02:12.753
- You hurt your what?
- I'm a very famous racecar!

00:02:13.033 --> 00:02:16.193
You are a famous racecar?
A real racecar?

00:02:16.273 --> 00:02:18.913
Yes, I'm a real racecar.
What do you think? Look at me.

00:02:18.993 --> 00:02:22.993
I have followed racing my entire life.
My whole life!

00:02:23.033 --> 00:02:25.353
Then you know who I am.
I'm Lightning McQueen.

00:02:25.393 --> 00:02:27.553
- Lightning McQueen?
- Yes! Yes!

00:02:27.593 --> 00:02:29.593
I must scream it to the world!

00:02:29.673 --> 00:02:33.873
My excitement from the top
of someplace very high!

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:36.473
- Do you know many Ferraris?
- No, no, no, no, no.

00:02:36.553 --> 00:02:39.513
They race on the European circuit.
I'm in the Piston Cup!

00:02:40.273 --> 00:02:43.233
- [Lightning] What?
- Luigi follow only the Ferraris.

00:02:48.073 --> 00:02:50.633
Is that what I think it is?

00:02:52.233 --> 00:02:53.473
[Sally] Customers.

00:02:53.553 --> 00:02:57.033
Customers!
Customers, everyone! Customers!

00:02:57.073 --> 00:02:58.433
- [Sally] OK!
- Customers?

00:02:58.513 --> 00:03:01.353
[Sally] Been a long time.
Remember what we rehearsed.

00:03:01.393 --> 00:03:03.993
Make sure your
"Open, please come in" signs are out.

00:03:04.073 --> 00:03:07.593
You all know what to do.
All right, nobody panics. Here we go!

00:03:07.673 --> 00:03:10.353
Van, I just don't see
any on-ramp anywhere.

00:03:10.433 --> 00:03:14.793
- Minny, I know exactly where we are.
- Yeah, we're in the middle of nowhere.

00:03:14.873 --> 00:03:17.553
- Honey, please.
- [Sally] Hello.

00:03:17.593 --> 00:03:20.593
Welcome to Radiator Springs,
gateway to Ornament Valley.

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:22.913
Legendary for
its service and hospitality.

00:03:22.953 --> 00:03:24.033
How can we help you?

00:03:24.113 --> 00:03:28.153
- We don't need anything, thank you.
- Ask for directions to the Interstate.

00:03:28.233 --> 00:03:31.433
There's no need to ask for directions.
I know where we're going.

00:03:31.513 --> 00:03:33.953
He did the same thing
on our trip to Shakopee.

00:03:34.033 --> 00:03:36.873
We were headed over there
for the Crazy Days, and we...

00:03:36.953 --> 00:03:39.993
- OK. Really. We're just peachy, OK?
- What you really need

00:03:40.073 --> 00:03:44.113
is the sweet taste
of my homemade, organic fuel.

00:03:44.193 --> 00:03:45.913
No, it doesn't agree with my tank.

00:03:45.953 --> 00:03:49.153
- Just trying to find the Interstate.
- Good to see you, soldier!

00:03:49.233 --> 00:03:52.593
Come on by Sarge's Surplus Hut
for your government surplus needs.

00:03:52.633 --> 00:03:54.953
- Honey, surplus!
- We have too much surplus.

00:03:55.033 --> 00:03:57.393
I do have a map
over at the Cozy Cone Motel.

00:03:57.473 --> 00:04:00.633
And if you stay, we offer a free
Lincoln Continental breakfast.

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:04.433
- Honey, she's got a map.
- I don't need a map! I have the GPS.

00:04:04.473 --> 00:04:07.953
- Never need a map again, thank you.
- How 'bout somethin' to drink?

00:04:08.033 --> 00:04:11.993
Stop at Flo's V-Eight Café.
Finest fuel on Route 66.

00:04:12.033 --> 00:04:13.193
No we just topped off.

00:04:13.273 --> 00:04:17.153
And if you need tires,
stop by Luigi's Casa Della Tires,

00:04:17.193 --> 00:04:19.633
home of the Leaning Tower of Tires.

00:04:19.713 --> 00:04:23.073
- We're trying to find the Interstate.
- But you do need a paint job.

00:04:23.153 --> 00:04:26.313
Ramone will paint you up right.
Hey, anything you want!

00:04:26.353 --> 00:04:28.673
- You know, like a flame job.
- No thanks...

00:04:28.753 --> 00:04:30.073
Maybe ghost flames!

00:04:30.153 --> 00:04:32.713
You like old school pinstripin'?
Von Dutch style?

00:04:32.793 --> 00:04:36.673
- [both gasp]
- Oh, honey, look. Von Dutch.

00:04:36.753 --> 00:04:39.793
[chuckling] OK, no.
We're gonna be going now, OK?

00:04:39.833 --> 00:04:41.353
Ow!

00:04:41.433 --> 00:04:44.633
[laughs] A little somethin'
to remember us by, OK?

00:04:44.833 --> 00:04:46.953
- OK!
- Come back soon, OK?

00:04:46.993 --> 00:04:50.513
I mean, you know where we are!
Tell your friends!

00:04:52.153 --> 00:04:54.193
[Van] OK! Yes. You bet.

00:04:54.273 --> 00:04:56.513
Thanks again, folks.
Bye-bye now.

00:04:56.593 --> 00:04:59.673
Psst! Psst!
Hey! Hey, hey, hey!

00:04:59.793 --> 00:05:01.953
- I know how to get to the Interstate!
- Do ya?

00:05:02.033 --> 00:05:04.713
- Minny, no.
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:05:04.753 --> 00:05:06.193
No, not really. But listen.

00:05:06.273 --> 00:05:09.913
I'm Lightning McQueen, famous racecar.
I'm being held against my will.

00:05:09.993 --> 00:05:12.553
I need you to call my team,
so they can come rescue me

00:05:12.593 --> 00:05:16.433
and get me to California in time for me
to win the Piston Cup. Understand?

00:05:17.393 --> 00:05:19.673
- [locks beeping]
- No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:05:19.713 --> 00:05:23.593
No, it's the truth! I'm telling you!
You gotta help me! Don't leave me here!

00:05:23.673 --> 00:05:26.833
I'm in hillbilly hell!
My IQ's dropping by the second!

00:05:26.873 --> 00:05:28.993
I'm becoming one of them!

00:05:29.073 --> 00:05:30.793
- [Lightning echoes]
- [sighing]

00:05:30.873 --> 00:05:33.033
OK, don't worry.
They know where we are now.

00:05:33.073 --> 00:05:34.833
They'll tell friends. You'll see.

00:05:34.913 --> 00:05:37.753
[Male DJ] We'll be back
for our Hank Williams marathon...

00:05:37.873 --> 00:05:40.553
- That's good.
- ...after a Piston Cup update.

00:05:40.633 --> 00:05:44.553
[Kori] Still no sign of Lightning
McQueen. Chick arrived in California

00:05:44.593 --> 00:05:48.073
and today became the first car
to spend practice time on the track.

00:05:48.153 --> 00:05:51.313
[Chick] It's nice to get out here
before the other competitors.

00:05:51.393 --> 00:05:55.153
You know, get a head start.
Gives me an edge.

00:05:55.233 --> 00:05:56.713
[electronic music]

00:05:56.753 --> 00:05:58.553
[laughing]

00:05:58.593 --> 00:06:00.433
Hoo-hoo-hoo!

